  "details": "Currently there is no way to view any information about the new SDK face tracking system while in motion. Please add a page to the Debug UI for the new face tracking system.\n\nIdeally it would contain:\n\n- Every Tracking Key name and their value.\n\n- Every Viseme Key name and their value.\n\n- The Voice parameter and its value.\n\n- Every Parameter Behavior and their resulting value (doesn't need to include the entire expression, just output Key/Parameter name and value).\n\n- Eye rotation values.\n\n- List of the modes set on the descriptor (Lipsync Mode, Eye Gaze Mode, Eyelid Type, FT Enabled, Viseme Dampen, Use All Tracking Keys).\n\n- List of all Blendshape Set names and their current weight. \n\n- Tracking/Animated states from the Avatar Debug for Eyes/Eyelids and Mouth.\n\n- Ideally also display the current tracking source (ie: OSC, Selfie Expression, or Emulated).",
